Honour CSS !important: a declaration marked important wins over every normal
one, inline or not, and a later normal declaration in the same block does not
replace it. Important stylesheet declarations rank above all normal ones by
specificity, important inline declarations above important stylesheet ones,
transitions above both, keyframe animations below important declarations, and
keyframes ignore important declarations, as in CSS.

